  "body": "Stacked on #1687 (merge #1687 first)\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\n\r\nDropdowns read `menu_width`, `recent_width`, `menu_gap`, and `menu_pad_x` from the theme.\r\nThe defaults remain 200, 300, 2, and 8 points.\r\nShared geometry fits menus inside narrow windows and keeps their panels and clickable rows aligned.\r\nMachine menus still expand for long labels before fitting the window.\r\nView checkbox spacing follows row height and padding.\r\nThe example lists every token supported by this stack base.\r\nThe built-in tables and file overlay move into child modules to keep the theme modules near 400 lines.\r\n\r\nEffort: medium.\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\n\r\nDropdown drawers used fixed dimensions and repeated row insets.\r\nTheme files could not override those values.\r\nMenus could extend past a narrow window.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\nThese pins failed on unchanged production code before the fix:\r\n\r\n- `narrow_window_clamps_dropdown_widths_to_stay_on_screen`\r\n- `all_dropdown_drawers_follow_theme_tokens`\r\n\r\nBoth now pass.\r\n`hostile_direct_dropdown_tokens_and_tiny_windows_stay_usable` also passes.\r\n`dropdown_tokens_parse_and_clamp` covers defaults, custom values, and both ends of each clamp.\r\n`the_theme_example_lists_every_supported_token` checks the example key sets and parsing.\r\nAll seven machine-mode tests pass.\r\n\r\nAll 24 mutations failed assertions and passed after restoration:\r\n`box_cap`, `direct_gap`, `direct_pad`, `direct_recent`, `direct_row`, `direct_width`, `fit_left`, `fit_left_lower`, `fit_width`, `fit_width_negative`, `fit_width_nonfinite`, `fixture_menu`, `from_tokens`, `icon_cap`, `layout`, `machine_width`, `panes`, `parser_gap`, `parser_pad`, `parser_recent`, `parser_width`, `recent_drop`, `theme_drop`, and `tree_menu`.\r\nDrawer mutations restore upstream's fixed geometry.\r\nRecent and View mutations omit newer APIs unavailable on this stack base.\r\nTree and Fixtures mutations preserve #1687's browser refusals.\r\n\r\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes with 805 passed and five existing ignored tests.\r\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passes.\r\n\r\n## Goldens moved\r\n\r\nNone in this patch against parent #1687.\r\nThe direct comparison with current upstream lists 270 inherited golden differences from the older stack base.\r\nThis patch changes none of them.\r\n\r\n## Merge-time refresh (2026-11-18)\r\n\r\nHead `c972e226d2ac731e184e3cee404f071773e512d4`. Commit `00b38e44f` merges `origin/main` (`b48c65828`). Commit `c972e226d` adds the pin for the icon spacing.\r\n\r\nHand-resolved files:\r\n\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs` (operation section dropdown): main's section icon now uses the shared metrics. The icon is at `clip_inset_x`, its size is `icon_px`, and the label is at `icon_text_x`. A row without an icon keeps its label at `pad_x`. The unused test constant `DROP_GAP` is removed.\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/dropdown.rs`: new field `icon_px`. The defaults give main's 4 / 16 / 28 layout.\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs`, `theme/clamp.rs`, `theme/tables.rs`, `theme_files/names.rs`, `theme_files/overlay.rs`, `assets/themes/theme.json.example`: main's newer theme fields and module split are kept. The four menu tokens are added to them.\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/recent_drop.rs`: main's Examples row is kept together with the fitted width and left edge.\r\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: main's workspace tab test is kept. The new test modules are added.\r\n- No snapshot PNG changed.\r\n\r\nThe decision is recorded in `docs/decisions/2065-theme-dropdown-tokens-uma.md`.\r\n\r\nNew and changed tests:\r\n\r\n- `op_dropdown_icon_and_label_follow_menu_metrics`: the default theme gives icon left +4, icon size 16 and label +28. A theme with `menu_pad_x` 16 gives icon left +8 and label +40. A mutation that fixes the label at 28 makes the test fail.\r\n- `dropdown_icon_clearance_derives_from_padding`: the clearance is inset + icon + padding for padding 0, 8, 16 and 32.\r\n- `all_dropdown_drawers_follow_theme_tokens`: the section row label assertion now includes the icon (row + 40).\r\n\r\nReadings after the refresh:\r\n\r\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: 9 steps, 0 failed. `ui suites: lib` gives 1118 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored.\r\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets --no-deps -- -D warnings`: clean.\r\n- The `#[test]` count of `crates/ui` is 1279. On `main` it is 1270.\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\nThe custom theme sets `menu_width` 260, `recent_width` 360, `menu_gap` 10 and `menu_pad_x` 16. \"Before\" is `main`, which refuses the unknown keys. The status bar is cropped.\r\n\r\n| | Before (main) | After (this PR) |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| Operations, default theme | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/before-ops-default.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/after-ops-default.png) |\r\n| Operations, custom theme | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/before-ops-custom.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/after-ops-custom.png) |\r\n| Recent projects, default theme | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/before-recent-default.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/after-recent-default.png) |\r\n| Recent projects, custom theme | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/before-recent-custom.png) | ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/screenshots/pr-2457/after-recent-custom.png) |\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\nNo interactive native or browser session ran. The screenshots come from the headless harness.\r\nNo wasm build ran.\r\nParent #1687 is still open. This branch contains its commits.\r\n\r\n## Overlaps\r\n\r\n#1687 changes `theme_drop::show` and `fixture_menu::fixture_menu`.\r\nThis branch starts at its head, `b706db9c726bbc082fa8819cb1fb0747ef251219`, and preserves its browser refusals.\r\n#1798 touches the same file, `panes.rs`, in the different `status` function; whichever merges second refreshes.\r\n#2432 touches the same file, `theme.rs`, in the different live-theme storage functions; whichever merges second refreshes.\r\n#2370, #2352, #2256, #2253, #2185, #2149, #2096, #2092, #2068, #1330, and #1209 touch the same file, `tests.rs`, in different functions or module declarations; whichever merges second refreshes.\r\nThis branch does not stack on held PR #1330.\r\n\r\nChangelog: Dropdown widths, trigger gaps, and row spacing follow theme tokens and fit narrow windows.\r\n\r\nFixes #2065\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n",
